# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim).
# Played by audio/jingles.js: game/chests.js, after the sfx chest (its hinge and lid).
# Meant to play over the chest sound, in place of its glint.
title    Treasure
composer Claude
about    A chest's glint: a crystal run up into the bird's wide call, a glass harmonica shimmer and wind chimes.
tempo    100
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.55

# mood explore: bird sweep harm chimes

voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.35 rev=0.75
voice sweep    crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.3 rev=0.6
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=0    center=A5 att=0.15 rel=1
voice chimes   chimes     vol=0.36 pan=-0.35

pattern glint
sweep   | A5 C6 E6 A6 .- .----- |
bird    | .----- E7 A6+B6---- |
harm    | .--- [Am]?------- |
chimes  | ...... x..... |

loop glint
